notes=('Video editor 82 old names reduced to 7 archetypes (Premiere, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Media Composer, Vegas Pro, iMovie, CapCut) plus 13 flat; dropped trade/broadcast (Autodesk Flame, Smoke, Avid DS, Xpress Pro, Blackbird, elevate.io, ivsEdits, Media 100, Video Toaster, EditDV, MainActor) and dead or niche tools (Windows Movie Maker, Windows Live Movie Maker, Nero Video, Ulead MediaStudio, Serif MoviePlus, ArcSoft ShowBiz, Pinnacle VideoSpin, VideoThang, Clesh, Kino, Cinelerra variants, LiVES, Pitivi, Open Movie Editor, LoiLoScope, WeVideo, YouTube Create, muvee, Natron, ObscuraCam, Xedio, VideoLAN Movie Creator, HTC Video Highlights, MPEG Video Wizard). '
 'Visual effects: four archetypes with versions from fetched pages. 2D animation 27 to 5 archetypes plus 12; dropped dead (Fantavision, Animator Pro and Studio, SWiSH Max, DrawPlus, Antics, Flipnote 3D, DigiCel) and merged Toonz into OpenToonz. Stop-motion is new: Dragonframe and Stop Motion Studio. '
 'Screenwriting 34 to 6 archetypes plus 11, prices from the studiobinder page; Arc Studio, Slugline, Trelby, Beat are old-data names not on any retrieved comparison. Video converter cut from 27 to 12.')
